The next morning, | est push
there was a note on our door. | med me:surprised@porch>door
== card day
"You looked." | card:note text="You looked." push
== kitchen day
Mom read it twice. | med mom:worried:letter
== bedroom day
Dad nailed my curtain shut. | med dad:reach>window
"Lights out, eyes in," he said. | cu dad:angry q:dad push
